  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Update last applied filter if and only if applying",
  "description": "If we apply a display filter, and the filter is empty, we\nwant to store the empty string in last applied as well, so\nwe don't present placeholder text suggesting that a filter\nis still being applied.\n\nIf we're only preparing a filter, then we don't want to\nstore that in the last_applied_ string, because then if someone\nerases the filter without applying it we'll present placeholder\ntext suggesting that the filter is currently being applied.\n\nAlways update the last applied filter in applyDisplayFilter\nif we're applying it (not if it's invalid and we return early.)",
